# Battle mines (w31r, Phase 11): battle.press's 2P BATTLE 1 plus one scene lever. Player 1's weapon slot is the
# halfword car+0x384 (type byte, ammo byte at +0x385) of gGameCar 0x80152818 (stride 0x3B8): func_8010D3C0
# (= GC _StartWeaponIcon) stores the picked-up weapon there (`sb a0,0x384(v0)`, `sb v1,0x385(v0)`, ammo from
